//!
//! GENERATED by tools/gen_rust_theme.py from tokens/tokens.json. Do not edit:
//! change the theme in web/, run `npm run tokens`, then rerun the script.
//!
//! Colors are `0xRRGGBBAA`, lengths are logical pixels (1rem = 16px), line
//! heights are multiples of the font size, durations are milliseconds.

